%% Session and stroke lifecycle on the Mac.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Launch
  Launch --> Recovering: previous run did not exit cleanly
  Launch --> NewSession: clean exit last time
  Recovering --> Active: load Sessions/{id}/strokes.json
  NewSession --> Active

  state Active {
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Drawing: stroke.begin
    Drawing --> Drawing: stroke.point
    Drawing --> Idle: stroke.end (commit + undo entry)
    Drawing --> Idle: stroke.cancel (discard; eraser rolled back)
    Drawing --> Idle: device lost / active peer changed (commit what arrived)
    Idle --> Idle: undo / redo / clear (clear is undoable)
  }

  Active --> Active: autosave every 5 s if revision changed (strokes.json + session.json)
  Active --> Saved: Save (⌃⌥S) → strokes.json, preview.png, export.pdf [+ background.png]
  Saved --> Active
  Active --> [*]: quit → final autosave, cleanExit = true
